  "id": "cloudsync-e2e-settings",
  "description": "End-to-end settings (§13.10). The product is in E2E mode (the default): a push carries ct, a sealed envelope, in place of value, and the pull answers ct with encryption and encryptionSince. A value, or an open setting whose key is not blinded, is rejected encryption_mismatch. A max setting is a compare-and-swap register: a stale baseVersion is a conflict carrying the server's ct, and the client re-pushes the better value on the server's version.",
